&lt;div class=&quot;job-post-container&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; background-color: white; padding: 20px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); min-height: 500px; border: 5px solid #000000; font-family: &#39;Geist&#39;, sans-serif; font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 2; width: 200px; height: 300px; margin-top: 30px; opacity: 1; z-index: 1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-post-content&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; z-index: 2;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-top: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/o2bwt8ar/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/CockroachLabs_Symbol_Black_2&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;92&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Geist&#39;, sans-serif; font-weight: 300; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;&quot;&gt;Category-defining tech. Career-defining work.&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Geist&#39;, sans-serif; font-weight: 300; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;For more than a decade, Cockroach Labs has built database technology trusted to power some of the world&#39;s most mission-critical applications. Now, as AI transforms how software is created and operated, the infrastructure behind it has to keep pace. Cockroach Continuum is built to meet this moment, bringing individual databases together into one fleet designed for agentic applications, where AI agents help teams provision, scale, and optimize workloads at machine speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Geist&#39;, sans-serif; font-weight: 300; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The customers you’ll work with are some of the most innovative businesses in the world, and the problems they’re trying to solve are real and urgent. You’ll bring a genuinely differentiated product to a market moving fast, at a company positioned to lead it. The people who thrive here are the ones who want to own that opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Geist&#39;, sans-serif; font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Geist&#39;, sans-serif; font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;Cockroach Labs is looking for a Sales Development Representative to help build the top of the sales funnel that will help fuel our Sales organization. You will grow our business by reaching the right people at the right companies at the right time – and then setting up these valuable opportunities for our sales team to close. You excel in high-energy environments and relish dealing with all the challenges that growth creates. You understand outbound sales prospecting across segments and a focus on improving the process of prospecting and lead generation.&lt;/p&gt;

